<!-- NOTES:

	Attributes:
	
	 refines_to_material: defines into which material this material transforms into.
	 refine_duration_in_seconds: defines how long it takes to create the refined material.
	 refine_consume_amount: defines how many materials are consumed to create one refines_to_material material.
	 fuel_duration_in_seconds: if defined and != 0, this material can be used as a fuel source for a refiner. Value -1 means infinite fuel time.
	 
	 Tags:
	 EDIBLE: shows up in cooking menu
	 RELIABLE: is assumed to be found all over the place. Safe to use for wishing well requests if no other material has been found.

-->

